who cares?

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.460
We're America, we do what we want.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.050
We know what is best.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:55.109
We know what is right.

00:00:55.109 --> 00:00:56.760
It doesn't matter what anybody else does.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:01.469
So it's actually worse than merely accepting
that self-inflicted ignorance.

00:01:01.469 --> 00:01:06.430
It is a movement that wears it as a badge
of honor and that is the scariest part of

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:07.430
it.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.110
And, um, I, I don't know what is going to
turn it around.

